# ICU's zone files for the edition in tzdata-edition, as web.Dockerfile
# downloads them: from one commit of unicode-org/icu-data, not from its main
# branch, and each checked against its hash here before Node reads it.
#
# A branch moves. Fetched from main, the same release built twice could get
# two sets of files, and a build cache would keep whichever it saw first. These
# are binary files parsed inside the server that renders every page, so they
# are the ones named here or the build stops.
#
# Moving the edition: the commit that added its folder, tzdata/icunew/<edition>
# (its history on GitHub), and the sha256 of each of the four files in that
# folder's 44/le. Until all of these match the edition, the build stops.
